    },
    "Automatic opens Home the first time each day when Today has a podcast or digest, and otherwise the forum you read last. Links, notifications, Siri and shared pages always open what they point to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”会在每天第一次打开且“今日”有播客或摘要时显示首页，否则打开你上次阅读的论坛。链接、通知、Siri 和分享的页面总是打开它们指向的内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「自動」會在每天第一次打開且「今日」有播客或摘要時顯示首頁，否則打開你上次閱讀的論壇。連結、通知、Siri 和分享的頁面一律打開它們指向的內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic puts it at the bottom on iPhone and in narrow windows, and at the top when the assistant is beside the page." : {
