    "Every connected minute is billed to your key. At a limit, voice finishes its answer and ends. Minutes are counted on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一分钟的连接都会计入你的密钥费用。达到限制时，语音会说完当前回答后结束。分钟数在本设备上计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一分鐘的連線都會計入你的金鑰費用。達到限制時，語音會說完目前的回答後結束。分鐘數在本裝置上計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every saved summary, chat, answer, and watched topic will be deleted. Your forums and settings stay." : {
