    "Forums are run by people and communities who pay for their servers. Reading a topic one page at a time keeps WukongMind a polite visitor and avoids being rate limited." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Summaries & chat › Forum requests footer",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "论坛由自掏服务器费用的个人和社区运营。一次读取一页，能让 WukongMind 做个礼貌的访客，也能避免被限速。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "論壇由自行負擔伺服器費用的個人和社群經營。一次讀取一頁，能讓 WukongMind 當個有禮貌的訪客，也能避免被限制速率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forums, summaries and chats follow you across your devices, end-to-end encrypted in your own iCloud." : {
